ter 等卡类。","source",{"_54":261,"_262":260},"publishedAt","selected",false,"Infosecurity Magazine","firstParty","d6dgg3e2wnqye3hjidrccizxr","Transport for London 数据泄露事件或影响约 265,000 名 Oyster photocard 用户","Transport for London 称，约 265,000 名 Oyster photocard 客户的姓名、电话、邮箱、住址、出生日期及安全问题和答案可能因系统入侵而泄露，密码、银行和支付卡资料等信息暂未发现被攻破。",{"_54":269,"_262":260},"2026-11-19T18:20:01.000Z",true,"BleepingComputer","hmxpr8kocuh4jba5f95359360","Transport for London Oyster photocard 网站遭入侵，约 265,000 名持卡人数据暴露","Transport for London（TfL）表示，Oyster photocard 网站遭入侵后，部分约 265,000 名持卡人的账户资料可能被访问，事件涉及儿童 Zip 卡和 60+ London Oyster photocard 持卡人。",{"_54":275,"_262":260},"2026-11-20T10:21:41.000Z","Help Net Security","av7vfypfk0eob5cw9nzl2x82n","伦敦公共交通系统遭遇网络攻击，导致 265K 名 Oyster photocard 用户数据暴露。当局表示事件已被控制；现有摘要未说明攻击者、攻击手段及具体暴露的数据类型。",{"_54":279,"_262":260},"Cybernews",{"_281":282,"_13":283,"_20":21,"_17":18,"_284":285},"factId","fvQXkO3cEDDk","TfL披露 photocard客户数据泄露","representative",{"_252":263,"_13":264,"_28":265,"_256":286,"_258":267,"_259":268},{"_54":269,"_262":260},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",8,{"_295":296,"_297":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
